<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have stepped up missile launches from Saada toward Aden, with projectiles landing in Dhamar and a strike on a civilian vehicle in Lahj that killed a child and injured three others, while a Houthi drone was intercepted by the Saudi-led coalition in the Red Sea. The coalition also intercepted another Houthi drone and a missile in western Yemen and hit a Houthi arms depot east of Taiz. The UK imposed sanctions on the Houthi group and four senior officials, and Saudi air strikes killed 17 people in a Yemeni city. Dozens of children have been killed in recent hostilities, and there were 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/yemen/core-yemen-situation-displacement-overview-23-nov-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/uk-sanctions-yemens-houthi-group-four-senior-officials?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/why-has-yemens-offensive-against-the-houthis-in-al-bayda-stalled?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNbVQyeHA3X3oxb0RfVjNDZlY3cWJRZHZ3TzQ3bm5oTGZhQXluaS1VaklVVEhOekZFeXc0RkVRbzhQSmM3MTBIUThDR2d1X2hnYUthS1NkbGNxQVJTel96aFozN1hiMjB3ckM1NjRiek5ERnJINzhTSFlIaGZfSmN2Rm16NnhKRnNvRldSaWpwREp4RmVYU0hPS09vU214clllOVNfVVpsejhpR19pV1dDLXFTaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPdXZnTDB3Q0xJQzYxY3lHUDd6SGJHYllqUFNKcGZDWG1keDVKcUxkbTdRQ1BmeDRKTEJJTEUxV19oOURtNmc5RWdVUlpBZlF0c0ZYd0ZSaGtCVHJ0T3poMlIxM3NmS1hkcnpvTHlNUkMxZEU5T3BQNmRINGphS0VreFl2cTdfQ1p3dThGOWtKQnZuTWhpdll2a0lNU3hOUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
